  "description": {
   "text": "Shapeshift: Iron Golem\nThe caster becomes an iron golem: Strength 24, Dexterity 9, base Armor Class 3, THAC0 3, 1 attack per round, 4d10 crushing damage as a +4 weapon. Magic Resistance 100%, fire resistance 125% (fire heals), 100% resistance to cold, electricity and acid, 20% to slashing, crushing, piercing and missile damage; only weapons of +3 or better can hurt it, and it cannot be backstabbed. Gas Cloud: a cloud of poison around a point within 20 feet poisons those who fail a save vs. Death at -2 for 18 seconds, 3 damage at a time; it can be used again after 3 rounds. No spells or items can be used in this form."
